---
title: "Readiness wait after a daemon restart: the transcript moves once, then stops"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Daemon restarted, evidence lost (pane idle)
  s1: Owner input at the front (pane idle)
  s2: Readiness wait (pane idle)
  s3: Retained unsent, no key
  s4: Readiness wait (pane idle, transcript moved)
  s5: Resend notice posted, front released
  s6: Bounded re-evaluation, window 1 (pane idle)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: owner takes the input
  s1 --> s2: wait starts, Stamp kept
  s2 --> s3: budget ends
  s2 --> s4: pane appends metadata
  s3 --> s5: resend notice
  s4 --> s6: budget ends
  s6 --> s3: window ends
